  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "銀行外匯業務",
    "sub_ename": "FOREIGN EXCHANGE BUSINESS OF CORPORATE BANKING",
    "describe_ch": "針對銀行中之外匯業務詳加介紹，並帶領同學做實務案例之說明與分析。課程涵蓋國際商務支付方式、企業放款、銀行國際匯兌、國際金融(OBU)業務、及銀行電子商務之介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the introduction of Foreign Exchange Business of Corporate Banking, and covers international payments, transaction based financing, international remittance, cash management, Offshore Banking Business(OBU), and Network Electronic Commerce.",
